"<ul><li>Verdant Parkside Living – Nestled in Yas Park’s lush greenery, residents enjoy breathtaking views and direct access to tranquil outdoor spaces.</li><li>Exclusive Penthouses &nbsp;– Three penthouses encircled by panoramic terraces with private infinity pool, VIP elevator access and more,</li><li>Exclusive World-Class Amenities – Sama Yas offers an impressive selection of facilities, including a boutique spa, theatre room, co-working spaces, fitness studio, and multiple pools.</li><li>Health &amp; Wellness Focused – Featuring cycling and running tracks, an outdoor fitness zone, and wellness spaces, promoting an active and balanced lifestyle.</li><li>Vibrant Community Experience – Strategically designed to encourage community engagement with multipurpose lounges, co-working pods, and a library, making it ideal for both relaxation and productivity.</li><li>Seamless Connectivity – Just minutes away from Yas Mall, Ikea Abu Dhabi, Ferrari World, Yas Waterworld, and Warner Bros. World, offering endless entertainment and retail options at your doorstep.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1409,"cta":{"id":2186,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Sama_Yas_in_Yas_Park_Island_by_Aldar_Abu_Dhabi_239a27604f.jpg","hash":"Sama_Yas_in_Yas_Park_Island_by_Aldar_Abu_Dhabi_239a27604f","name":"Sama Yas in Yas Park Island by Aldar - Abu Dhabi"},"style":null,"title":"Nature’s Serenity, Island’s Luxury—Live Elevated at Sama Yas.","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Sama Yas by Aldar is nestled within the lush greenery of Yas Park on Yas Island, Abu Dhabi, offering a nature-inspired and elevated lifestyle. This prime location provides breathtaking verdant views and seamless access to key landmarks on the island. Residents can enjoy world-class amenities, including a fully equipped gym, running and cycling tracks, co-working spaces, retail areas, a boutique spa, and a 24/7 concierge. Sama Yas ensures a perfect blend of tranquility and convenience, making it an ideal destination for luxurious modern living.</p><ul><li>05 Minutes to Yas Acres Golf Club</li><li>08 Minutes to Ikea Abu Dhabi</li><li>08 Minutes to Yas Mall</li><li>08 Minutes to Ferrari World</li><li>08 Minutes to Yas Waterworld</li><li>10 Minutes to Warner Brothers World</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":1543,"url":"","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":811,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":3362,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartments","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3363,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartments","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3364,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Apartments","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3365,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Duplex Apartments","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3366,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Duplex Apartments","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3367,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Garden Apartments","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3368,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"3 Bedroom Garden Apartments","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3369,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"5 Bedroom Penthouses ","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"60/40","payment_plans":[{"id":9956,"title":"60%","description":"During Construction"},{"id":9957,"title":"40%","description":"On Handover"}],"community":"Yas Island","publish":1,"currency":"","amenities":[{"id":22644,"url":null,"text":"The Canopy Club","type":null,"image":null},{"id":22645,"url":null,"text":"Maison Mocha Coffee Shop","type":null,"image":null},{"id":22646,"url":null,"text":"Curzon Lounge Cinema","type":null,"image":null},{"id":22647,"url":null,"text":"The Reading Room Library","type":null,"image":null},{"id":22648,"url":null,"text":"Serenity Suite Spa","type":null,"image":null},{"id":22649,"url":null,"text":"Club Gym","type":null,"image":null},{"id":22650,"url":null,"text":"Exercise Track","type":null,"image":null},{"id":22651,"url":null,"text":"Playroom","type":null,"image":null},{"id":22652,"url":null,"text":"Exclusive House Car","type":null,"image":null},{"id":22653,"url":null,"text":"Room Service","type":null,"image":null},{"id":22654,"url":null,"text":"Swimming Pool","type":null,"image":null}],"bitrix":{"id":1147,"pf_id":"are.2.13486","source":null,"project_id":"Sama Yas","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Sama Yas","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Aldar Properties","project_location":"Yas Island"},"banner_image_mobile":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Sama_Yas_in_Yas_Park_Island_by_Aldar_Abu_Dhabi_e82ad9e523.jpg","hash":"Sama_Yas_in_Yas_Park_Island_by_Aldar_Abu_Dhabi_e82ad9e523","name":"Sama Yas in Yas Park Island by Aldar - Abu Dhabi"},"seo":{"id":1680,"metaTitle":"Sama Yas in Yas Park Island by Aldar - Abu Dhabi","canonicalURL":null,"metaDescription":"Experience luxury and nature at Sama Yas by Aldar in Yas Park, Abu Dhabi. Choose from 1-3 bedroom apartments, duplexes, premium residences, world-class amenities, and seamless island connectivity."},"more_info":[{"id":5708,"answer":"<p>Sama Yas offers a variety of residential options, including 1, 2, and 3-bedroom apartments, duplexes, and garden apartments. Each unit is designed to blend luxury with nature, providing spacious layouts and stunning park views.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What types of residences are available at Sama Yas by Aldar?"},{"id":5709,"answer":"<p>Sama Yas features a range of world-class amenities, including a boutique spa, retail outlets, a theatre room, co-working spaces, adult and kids' swimming pools, a fitness studio, and multifunctional rooms. The development also offers cycling and running tracks, a library, and lush common gardens.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What are the key amenities offered at Sama Yas?"},{"id":5710,"answer":"<p>Sama Yas aims for Estidama 3 Pearl, Fitwel, and LEED Gold Certifications, ensuring that the development prioritizes eco-friendly design and sustainable living. Features like energy-efficient systems, water conservation methods, and waste management support a green lifestyle.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"How is Sama Yas focused on sustainability?"},{"id":5711,"answer":"<p>Sama Yas offers a flexible <strong>60/40</strong> payment plan, making it easier for investors and homeowners to secure their dream property. The starting price for units is <strong>AED 1.9M, </strong>with handover expected in <strong>2027.</strong> The payment structure is broken down as follows:<br><strong>• Down Payment: 10%</strong><br><strong>• Construction Start: 5%</strong><br><strong>• Enabling and Piling: 5%</strong><br><strong>• Sub Structure (Up to tower GF slab): 10%</strong><br><strong>• Super Structure Completion: 15%</strong><br><strong>• Façade Completion: 15%</strong><br><strong>• Completion: 40%</strong><br>For more details on the payment plan and milestones, you can reach out to Zoya Ventures Real Estate for assistance in securing your property at Sama Yas.</p>","question":"What is the payment plan and starting price for Sama Yas?"},{"id":5712,"answer":"<p>Sama Yas enjoys a prime location, offering easy access to key attractions such as Yas Mall, Ferrari World, Yas Waterworld, and Warner Bros. World, all within a short drive. The development is also just minutes from Yas Acres Golf Club and Ikea Abu Dhabi.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"How far is Sama Yas from major attractions on Yas Island?"},{"id":5713,"answer":"<p>Sama Yas is working towards achieving Estidama 3 Pearl, Fitwel, and LEED Gold Certification, which will make the development an eco-friendly, energy-efficient, and sustainable place to live, ensuring long-term environmental impact.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What certifications is Sama Yas aiming to achieve?"},{"id":5714,"answer":"<p>To buy a property at Sama Yas, you can get in touch with Zoya Ventures Real Estate, a trusted real estate agency, to guide you through the process. Zoya Ventures Real Estate offers expert advice on available units and payment plans and will assist you in securing your dream home at Sama Yas.</p>","question":"How can I purchase a property at Sama Yas by Aldar?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Abu Dhabi","documents":null,"future_launch":null,"adroll":null,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"i/Sama_Yas_in_Yas_Park_Island_by_Aldar_Abu_Dhabi_77dfab0814.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Sama_Yas_in_Yas_Park_Island_by_Aldar_Abu_Dhabi_77dfab0814.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/420x/Sama_Yas_in_Yas_Park_Island_by_Aldar_Abu_Dhabi_77dfab0814.webp","format":"webp","transform":"420x","created_at":"2025-03-14 10:51:48.900","updated_at":"2025-03-14 10:51:48.900"}]},{"src_url":"i/Sama_Yas_in_Yas_Park_Island_by_Aldar_Abu_Dhabi_239a27604f.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Sama_Yas_in_Yas_Park_Island_by_Aldar_Abu_Dhabi_239a27604f.jpg","transforms":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/x/1392x/Sama_Yas_in_Yas_Park_Island_by_Aldar_Abu_Dhabi_239a276